-- Names for character_set_walk_variant / character_set_run_variant /
-- character_set_stand_variant (natives; ss10.lua is the only caller: "Walk Hacking",
-- "Run Hacking", "Stand Ready Hacking"). Those three are anim STATE names from
-- anim_states.xtbl (category Hacking), so these lists are the states whose names say walk /
-- run (or sprint, jog) / stand, combat, weapon, vehicle and transition ("to") states left out.
-- Inferred from the naming; only the hacking trio is known to work. { state, display, group }
-- plus sets = which of GML1, GFL1, PML1, PFL1 (with parents) define the state: it only shows
-- if the character's anim set has it ("Walk Hacking" is only in GFL1, Shaundi's set).
-- "custom walk male/female/extra N" are the crib walk styles (cribs.xtbl Walk_Style_Trigger).
